Package: pertEvalR
Type: Package
Title: Calibrated Evaluation of Single-Cell Perturbation Response Predictions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Chaoya", "Wang", email = "wanchaoya3@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A framework for evaluating models that predict transcriptional
    responses to genetic or chemical perturbations from single-cell data
    (for example Perturb-seq). Provides standard data splits, reference
    baselines (control, training mean, additive and linear models),
    per-perturbation metrics that separate perturbation-specific effects from
    systematic variation, calibrated scores placed between an uninformative
    lower bound and a technical-replicate upper bound, paired statistical
    comparison of models with bootstrap confidence intervals, and dataset
    diagnostics (systematic variation, split-half reliability) for choosing
    the perturbations on which models can be told apart.
